* A macro body that leaves a conditional open (an iflt ... else without endc): r68 keeps it open
* after the call, the rest of the source in it (assembled after a call that ends in the else
* part, left out after one that doesn't: here the last nop); gas refused the macro ("end of
* macro inside conditional").
* fixed: ca33983 2026-10-12 r68togas: conditionals a macro body leaves open stay open after the call; padding when ends is left out
* expect text: 01020304 05060700
Mk macro
 dc.b \1
 iflt \#-2
 dc.b 0
 else
 dc.b \2,\3
 endm
 psect macro_open_cond,0,0,0,0,0
 Mk 1,2,3
 Mk 4,5,6
 Mk 7
 nop
 ends
